  "body": "Republish the exact signed canonical SDPTool 2.3.1 engine from the integrated source. Its default project Framework is 2.3.1, with the original signed 2.3.0 added as a supported upgrade predecessor.\n\nUpdate with `gh extension upgrade sdp`. Run `gh sdp setup` once if the shared standalone entrypoint has not been registered. Project upgrades remain explicit preview/apply operations and preserve project-owned documents.\n\nLinux amd64. Engine and extension share one update path; XFMD invokes the registered engine offline without GitHub CLI or authentication.\n"
